 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rXLiQ8YRgaYQ7kNvwGqbzsB&_nc_oc=AdlzhC9_x8bvZszF7ILcWkJaHPzjcBgApuKlAtMOusDekPf4mpaOpuzzqFTOQxypP1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwAvXCiAfUSpHGzgSgnAYQplfKCFhS1GlGGkWFHDd_meg&oe=69BE7C39"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WDcI-Egfn3QQ7kNvwHAJwDj&_nc_oc=AdlE1a5i6rS2H5LR_N6aQVXbI83M2ml9obO28wYbs94UBSdYvTRHO0HmZ7XBMYInbHY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyMwFQBu_NqpLVguKKVCfkqs9e93Xe3OAGNmX1mPlWxxw&oe=69BE8BD3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jq3wDZuGbY0Q7kNvwEMBmse&_nc_oc=Adnclxvkw734Vjy8eSywbIbadcd5uE__LW7ih40HXih30yfwdYQlbgZ9mJn5ZVCz1jU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzOT9qAECrjcWFXTTFsIitZvITXDUuOK4pUCW3aF1fyPg&oe=69BE977B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=03kAEKedUDEQ7kNvwENEY9Z&_nc_oc=Adnjyc7P7yEpO2L1IsDPE2q6p-vqO-8Ky0_MftgagHVUIDlHA3Tc0Ol0MHF52tLGmGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwxJzN3Rlhu5GtOFhJjA3nRNbc0EhPeL6WDxwZB7qUO2w&oe=69BE98CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_b0YsJCm2eEQ7kNvwEhlBXV&_nc_oc=AdmYdXh-2YhoV8bG8Eck7atE_S9yCQcwn_0QRRJT4iMrt_FLsfacBc3ySig0CVj3gwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzu1O4QQZCQ9wiiEtMNt69o-15NTYFg2PtDWP9Dg7NjiA&oe=69BE81FE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp